🚨 7. BIGGEST DESIGN RULES (DO NOT BREAK THESE)

These are the rules your v2 must obey:

RULE 1 — MEMBERS ≠ USERS

A member is a business entity, not just a login.

RULE 2 — ONE USER CAN BELONG TO MULTIPLE GYMS

Your current system breaks this.

RULE 3 — SUPER ADMIN IS PLATFORM ONLY

